@startuml
title WF-01 Classroom Robot Allocation
|School Admin|
start
:Choose classroom and entitled robot;
|VISTA Web|
:GET eligible robots; PUT allocation;
|Education API|
:Authenticate and verify school_admin allocation permission;
if (Classroom organization and robot entitlement valid?) then (yes)
  |Database|
  :Upsert one allocation per classroom;
  |Education API|
  :Return safe robot projection;
  |Instructor|
  :Read authorized classroom and allocated robot;
else (no)
  :Return not found / authorization rejection;
endif
stop
@enduml
